sequenceDiagram
  actor Doc as Doctor
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant API as Backend API
  participant Q as Redis queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Doc->>UI: choose scan (+ optional symptoms), Upload
  UI->>API: POST /api/patients/{id}/cases (multipart, streamed)
  API->>API: validate DICOM, pick series, de-identify
  API->>DB: case Uploaded → Validating → Queued
  API->>Q: enqueue analysis
  API-->>UI: 201 case (queued)
  Q->>W: analyse_case(id)
  W->>DB: Preprocessing
  W->>W: lung mask, resample 1.5 mm, crop, 128³
  W->>DB: Analysing
  W->>W: 5-fold ensemble → logit → temperature → p(TB)
  W->>W: Grad-CAM heatmaps, then fusion with age, sex, symptoms
  W->>DB: result, Completed, notification
  UI->>API: GET /api/cases/{id}/result
  API-->>UI: CT-only (+ combined) result, previews, heatmaps
  Doc->>UI: Download PDF report
